# Frozen audio boundaries (epic #64, issue #69)
#
# These paths carry the media invariants: no codec, bitrate, sample-rate,
# buffer, gain, crossfader, or audio-lifecycle change without the
# `audio-touching` PR label and explicit review from Nico. The
# .github/workflows/audio-boundary.yml check enforces the label in CI.
#
# Note: GitHub CODEOWNERS cannot escape the `[id]` glob in App Router paths,
# so the whole session route directory is owned instead.

/src/context/AudioContext.tsx @nicoechaniz
/src/app/session/ @nicoechaniz
/services/playlist-bot/ @nicoechaniz

